   "id": 329872,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "A knight’s tour is not possible on a four-by-four board like the one shown in the figure. Find an open tour of the board in which the knight is permitted to travel through a given space more than once to achieve the goal of visiting every space. Is your tour most accurately described as a walk, trail, or path? Explain why.\n<br>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/b9364f2400f72527.png\" alt=\"A 4 by 4 square chess board. A knight is at the bottom-left of the board.\">\n\n",
